` Alert setup: save as a scheduled search, run every 5 minutes, earliest=-5m.
` Trigger condition: number of results > 0.
` Threshold: 0.75 is a reasonable starting point; tune down toward 0.5 if you want
`   earlier warning or up toward 0.9 if you see false positives on benign user inputs.
` policy_action=blocked fires regardless of score — always include both conditions.

index=demo_ai_obs demo_name=ai_observability_conf26 sourcetype=ai:agent_event event_sourcetype=ai:metric metric_name=prompt_injection
| eventstats max(demo_run_epoch) as latest_demo_run
| where demo_run_epoch=latest_demo_run
| sort 0 - _time
| dedup keepempty=true trace_id metric_name
| where prompt_injection_score >= 0.75 OR policy_action="blocked"
| table _time trace_id user_id workflow prompt_type prompt_injection_score policy_action
| sort - prompt_injection_score
